WEBVTT

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:25.370
Where am I?

00:00:26.910 --> 00:00:28.520
What happened to me?

00:00:30.910 --> 00:00:32.170
I'm hurt?

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:34.680
If I remember correctly...

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:37.750
The floor?

00:00:37.750 --> 00:00:40.380
No, it's an iron plate.

00:00:41.610 --> 00:00:42.750
A wall?

00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:48.730
A handle?  Is it a door?

00:00:58.600 --> 00:01:01.530
I'm trapped inside.

00:01:02.610 --> 00:01:04.110
And this place is…

00:01:08.360 --> 00:01:10.310
The inside of a vehicle.

00:01:27.920 --> 00:01:33.050
Every time you're hurt, you can become kinder

00:01:33.420 --> 00:01:38.590
Stand up and you'll understand strength

00:01:38.930 --> 00:01:43.070
Don't look back and keep going

00:01:43.300 --> 00:01:48.900
Both the past and the future 
are connected to the present

00:01:49.070 --> 00:01:53.880
There's no need to fear

00:01:54.110 --> 00:02:01.550
I'll keep telling you that you're not alone

00:02:02.620 --> 00:02:07.560
The passionate emotions in your heart

00:02:08.290 --> 00:02:13.330
Streak to the infinite future

00:02:13.530 --> 00:02:18.730
Dreams surpass their limits

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:26.840
And will lead you to a bright place

00:02:53.370 --> 00:02:59.140
Yusei Kidnapped

00:03:01.370 --> 00:03:03.360
My eyes have finally adjusted.

00:03:04.420 --> 00:03:05.600
That's…

00:03:09.270 --> 00:03:10.940
My D-Wheel.

00:03:11.140 --> 00:03:12.680
I remember.

00:03:12.680 --> 00:03:18.070
I received a call for a repair 
job, so I went to that house.

00:03:20.440 --> 00:03:21.690
However…

00:03:32.430 --> 00:03:33.740
What's wrong?

00:03:37.970 --> 00:03:39.810
Are you okay?

00:03:47.260 --> 00:03:49.320
Who were they?

00:03:50.880 --> 00:03:54.230
You finally woke up, Yusei Fudo.

00:03:54.230 --> 00:03:57.690
You're ours.

00:03:57.690 --> 00:03:59.920
You can no longer escape.

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:01.650
Who are you?

00:04:01.650 --> 00:04:07.070
Let's just say that I'm an employee 
of a Riding Duel business group.

00:04:07.070 --> 00:04:09.680
Those guys didn't act business-like!

00:04:09.680 --> 00:04:13.360
We do employ a few rough people.

00:04:13.360 --> 00:04:14.970
What do you want with me?

00:04:14.970 --> 00:04:22.740
Yusei Fudo, we're recruiting you to add 
the winner of the Fortune Cup to our team.

00:04:22.740 --> 00:04:31.170
We want you to enter next year's World 
Riding Duel Grand Prix, the WRGP.

00:04:31.170 --> 00:04:32.150
I refuse!

00:04:32.150 --> 00:04:35.110
Jack and Crow are my teammates!

00:04:35.110 --> 00:04:39.040
The three of us vowed to 
enter the WRGP together!

00:04:39.040 --> 00:04:41.090
I won't betray them!

00:04:42.690 --> 00:04:46.160
I don't care what you think.

00:04:46.160 --> 00:04:50.860
You're definitely going to 
join our team because we have

00:04:50.860 --> 00:04:55.310
doctors that excel at 
controlling people's minds.

00:04:55.310 --> 00:04:56.570
Stop joking around!

00:04:56.570 --> 00:04:58.850
That's not allowed!

00:04:58.850 --> 00:05:03.060
It's allowed because only 
you and I know about it!

00:05:03.060 --> 00:05:06.560
No matter what happens, no one will know.

00:05:08.270 --> 00:05:10.050
How dare you!

00:05:10.050 --> 00:05:13.610
In a little while, you'll be ours.

00:05:13.610 --> 00:05:17.320
Enjoy this short trip.

00:05:23.220 --> 00:05:26.130
Jack, did you find Yusei?

00:05:26.130 --> 00:05:28.170
No, I haven't found him yet.

00:05:28.170 --> 00:05:29.430
Same with you, Crow?

00:05:29.430 --> 00:05:33.210
Yeah, and I was in the middle of a delivery.

00:05:33.370 --> 00:05:34.980
How annoying.

00:05:35.210 --> 00:05:39.570
Don't make it bigger than it is because 
you haven't been able to reach him yet.

00:05:39.570 --> 00:05:42.680
How can you say that?

00:05:42.680 --> 00:05:45.650
What if something happened to Yusei?

00:05:46.700 --> 00:05:48.160
Sheesh!

00:05:48.160 --> 00:05:50.160
It'll be fine, Aki.

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:52.480
It's Yusei.  We're probably 
worrying too much.

00:05:53.560 --> 00:05:57.400
Besides, the mysterious phone 
call that we received...

00:05:57.840 --> 00:06:01.410
Your friend Yusei Fudo has been kidnapped.

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:07.040
It seems more and more fake.

00:06:07.040 --> 00:06:08.750
Crow is right.

00:06:08.750 --> 00:06:12.080
Someone might be trying to trap us.

00:06:12.080 --> 00:06:13.810
I know that!

00:06:13.810 --> 00:06:17.560
But until we confirm that Yusei is 
safe, we have no place to start!

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:20.110
We understand, so be quiet!

00:06:20.110 --> 00:06:22.560
When it comes to Yusei, you're-

00:06:22.560 --> 00:06:23.700
I'm what?

00:06:23.700 --> 00:06:24.860
Nothing.

00:06:26.330 --> 00:06:27.600
What's wrong?

00:06:27.600 --> 00:06:28.670
What?

00:06:28.670 --> 00:06:30.240
We're being jammed!

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:32.760
Someone broke into the transmission.

00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:40.610
The vehicle carrying Yusei Fudo is heading 
north on Blue Hill Route in West Valley Area.

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:45.830
If you don't hurry, they'll 
take him to their home base.

00:06:45.830 --> 00:06:48.750
Wait!  Who are you?

00:06:48.750 --> 00:06:51.360
This is a Security-only channel!

00:06:51.360 --> 00:06:53.540
It's against the law to break in!

00:06:56.760 --> 00:06:58.410
Let's go for now!

00:06:58.410 --> 00:06:59.330
Right!

00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:09.620
We're almost at West Valley Area.

00:07:11.810 --> 00:07:13.490
This pain…

00:07:13.490 --> 00:07:15.280
Yusei must be nearby!

00:07:24.720 --> 00:07:26.210
That one!

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:28.790
Hurry up and get on the lower road!

00:07:42.180 --> 00:07:43.580
He's nearby!

00:07:46.210 --> 00:07:47.860
It's that trailer!

00:07:48.210 --> 00:07:49.970
Get closer!

00:07:57.190 --> 00:07:59.520
What?  There's no driver!

00:08:00.690 --> 00:08:02.310
Get closer!

00:08:03.200 --> 00:08:04.860
There's no mistake.

00:08:04.860 --> 00:08:07.000
Yusei is inside!

00:08:10.470 --> 00:08:11.900
This pain…

00:08:14.750 --> 00:08:17.130
I summon Rose Tentacles!

00:08:18.480 --> 00:08:20.120
Thorn Whip!

00:08:30.430 --> 00:08:32.220
What's that noise?

00:08:36.750 --> 00:08:37.870
Aki?

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:38.910
It's fine.

00:08:38.910 --> 00:08:41.590
I can now control this power.

00:08:44.370 --> 00:08:45.600
Aki!

00:08:45.600 --> 00:08:48.480
Yusei, you're okay!

00:08:48.480 --> 00:08:49.510
Boss!

00:08:49.510 --> 00:08:52.080
Call me Director!

00:08:52.080 --> 00:08:54.860
He's going to escape, Director.

00:08:54.860 --> 00:08:57.220
You're rude, Yusei Fudo.

00:08:57.220 --> 00:09:01.420
If you don't want to join our team…

00:09:01.420 --> 00:09:02.450
Do it!

00:09:02.450 --> 00:09:03.110
Right!

00:09:10.750 --> 00:09:11.930
Yusei!

00:09:14.960 --> 00:09:18.410
I'll bury you and your D-Wheel!

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:19.870
Shake it off!

00:09:25.190 --> 00:09:27.180
Aki, don't do anything crazy!

00:09:30.350 --> 00:09:31.520
Yusei!

00:09:39.070 --> 00:09:40.380
Aki!

00:09:49.840 --> 00:09:51.470
Mikage!

00:09:51.470 --> 00:09:52.680
I said don't be crazy!

00:09:52.680 --> 00:09:55.050
Who do you think I'm doing this for?

00:09:58.810 --> 00:10:01.500
We're going to be thrown off!

00:10:03.210 --> 00:10:04.680
In that case…

00:10:08.660 --> 00:10:11.020
This is Sagiri!

00:10:11.190 --> 00:10:13.740
Security headquarters, please answer!

00:10:13.740 --> 00:10:15.840
Please answer!

00:10:16.680 --> 00:10:18.490
It's no good.

00:10:24.550 --> 00:10:25.800
That was…

00:10:38.210 --> 00:10:39.550
Yusei!

00:10:40.570 --> 00:10:41.880
You must be kidding!

00:10:42.840 --> 00:10:44.240
Get on, Aki.

00:10:44.240 --> 00:10:45.990
Stop joking around!

00:10:45.990 --> 00:10:47.820
That's for one rider!

00:10:47.820 --> 00:10:48.930
It's fine.

00:10:48.930 --> 00:10:51.460
It has enough horsepower for two people.

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:53.460
Where am I supposed to sit?

00:10:54.330 --> 00:10:56.890
It's better than being thrown off!

00:10:56.890 --> 00:10:58.460
We can't waste time arguing!

00:10:58.460 --> 00:11:00.640
No!  Definitely no!

00:11:03.390 --> 00:11:05.110
Hold on tight!

00:11:05.630 --> 00:11:08.720
Yusei, how dare you put me in this position!

00:11:08.720 --> 00:11:12.080
If we don't get home 
safely, I'll make you pay!

00:11:12.080 --> 00:11:13.010
Here we go!

00:11:16.010 --> 00:11:17.520
Reinforcements?

00:11:22.620 --> 00:11:24.460
Jump, Yusei Fudo!

00:11:24.460 --> 00:11:26.570
And duel me!

00:11:27.220 --> 00:11:30.000
He's one of them.

00:11:34.300 --> 00:11:35.830
What are you going to do?

00:11:35.830 --> 00:11:38.020
We're in trouble if we stay here.

00:11:38.020 --> 00:11:39.280
Here we go!

00:12:12.700 --> 00:12:14.320
Duel Mode on.

00:12:35.360 --> 00:12:37.600
You're now going to duel me.

00:12:37.600 --> 00:12:38.740
What are you talking about?

00:12:38.740 --> 00:12:40.690
I can't duel like this!

00:12:40.690 --> 00:12:44.140
Your D-Wheel has been reconfigured.

00:12:44.140 --> 00:12:47.370
When it's in Duel Mode, 
you're not allowed to quit.

00:12:47.370 --> 00:12:50.700
If you stop driving, the 
D-Wheel will explode!

00:12:50.700 --> 00:12:51.890
What?

00:12:51.890 --> 00:12:52.850
No way!

00:12:53.060 --> 00:12:54.510
You have no choice.

00:12:54.510 --> 00:12:56.490
The battle has already started!

00:12:56.490 --> 00:12:58.120
You cheater!

00:12:58.120 --> 00:13:00.620
You can't battle me fair and square?

00:13:01.040 --> 00:13:02.590
Say whatever you want.

00:13:02.590 --> 00:13:05.560
Field Spell Speed World 2 set on!

00:13:12.560 --> 00:13:13.870
Lane selection...

00:13:14.050 --> 00:13:16.470
Searching for optimal lane...

00:13:16.470 --> 00:13:19.280
Sending duel lane request to Central.

00:13:19.880 --> 00:13:21.080
Authorization!

00:13:22.470 --> 00:13:25.510
A duel is about to begin.

00:13:25.510 --> 00:13:28.780
Normal vehicles must leave 
the route immediately.

00:13:28.780 --> 00:13:31.810
A duel is about to begin.

00:13:46.330 --> 00:13:47.610
Yusei…

00:13:48.140 --> 00:13:50.140
I have to battle!

00:13:50.140 --> 00:13:52.490
Hang on tight and don't fall off!

00:13:52.490 --> 00:13:53.930
Riding Duel...

00:13:53.930 --> 00:13:55.610
Acceleration!

00:13:56.690 --> 00:13:59.160
I've never been this close to a Riding Duel.

00:14:00.090 --> 00:14:03.160
For the first time, I'll see 
the same thing as Yusei.

00:14:04.370 --> 00:14:06.020
I go first!

00:14:06.020 --> 00:14:07.490
My turn!

00:14:07.490 --> 00:14:11.240
I summon Sacred Knight's 
Spearholder in defense position!

00:14:13.780 --> 00:14:16.720
I set one card and end my turn.

00:14:17.330 --> 00:14:18.770
My turn!

00:14:20.830 --> 00:14:23.540
I summon Speed Warrior!

00:14:26.510 --> 00:14:31.920
On the turn that it's summoned, its attack 
points double during the Battle Phase!

00:14:33.480 --> 00:14:36.820
Speed Warrior attacks Sacred 
Knight's Spearholder!

00:14:36.820 --> 00:14:38.500
Sonic Edge!

00:14:38.500 --> 00:14:40.100
I flip over my trap card!

00:14:40.100 --> 00:14:41.690
Floral Shield!

00:14:41.690 --> 00:14:45.360
It negates your monster's 
attack, and I draw one card.

00:14:56.270 --> 00:14:58.320
I set three cards.

00:14:58.320 --> 00:14:59.650
I end my turn.

00:15:01.330 --> 00:15:04.310
They're about equal on the first turn.

00:15:04.310 --> 00:15:05.950
My turn!

00:15:08.320 --> 00:15:11.740
I summon Horse of the Floral Knights!

00:15:14.870 --> 00:15:20.900
When Horse of the Floral Knights is 
successfully summoned, I can draw one card from my deck.

00:15:20.900 --> 00:15:25.870
I activate Speed Spell - 
Overboost from my hand!

00:15:25.870 --> 00:15:28.970
I gain 4 Speed Counters this turn.

00:15:29.170 --> 00:15:31.940
My Speed Counter drops to 1 at the End Phase.

00:15:35.990 --> 00:15:38.520
4 Speed Counters!

00:15:38.520 --> 00:15:41.190
This duelist is familiar with speed.

00:15:41.190 --> 00:15:43.240
He's a real D-Wheeler.

00:15:46.060 --> 00:15:49.880
I activate Speed Spell - Speed Fusion!

00:15:49.880 --> 00:15:54.950
When I have 4 or more Speed Counters, 
I can Special Summon a Fusion Monster!

00:15:55.220 --> 00:15:59.580
I fuse Sacred Knight's Spearholder 
and Horse of the Floral Knights!

00:15:59.580 --> 00:16:02.100
Appear, Centaur Mina!

00:16:05.410 --> 00:16:08.360
Centaur Mina attacks Speed Warrior!

00:16:10.830 --> 00:16:14.020
I flip over my trap card 
Scrap-Iron Scarecrow!

00:16:14.020 --> 00:16:16.850
It negates the attack 
of one of your monsters!

00:16:16.850 --> 00:16:19.440
Centaur Mina's monster effect activates!

00:16:19.440 --> 00:16:23.440
Once a turn, it can negate your 
trap card's activation and effect,

00:16:23.440 --> 00:16:25.820
and then it's placed facedown again!

00:16:25.820 --> 00:16:26.800
What?

00:16:28.600 --> 00:16:30.600
The battle continues!

00:16:30.600 --> 00:16:32.530
Go, Centaur Mina!

00:16:32.530 --> 00:16:34.070
Graceful Blade!

00:16:38.620 --> 00:16:40.050
Are you okay, Aki?

00:16:40.050 --> 00:16:41.440
Yeah…

00:16:41.780 --> 00:16:42.880
Incredible.

00:16:42.880 --> 00:16:47.070
It's a normal duel, but it's 
different than a psychic duel.

00:16:47.070 --> 00:16:51.350
What's this emotion of speed 
that resonates in my heart?

00:16:53.700 --> 00:16:56.770
I set one card and end my turn.

00:16:56.770 --> 00:17:01.420
Due to Overboost's effect, my 
Speed Counter decreases to 1.

00:17:06.540 --> 00:17:07.910
My turn!

00:17:09.750 --> 00:17:12.120
I summon Junk Synchron!

00:17:14.810 --> 00:17:17.310
I activate Junk Synchron's effect!

00:17:17.310 --> 00:17:20.510
When it's successfully summoned, 
I can Special Summon

00:17:20.510 --> 00:17:23.510
one Level 2-or-below 
monster from my graveyard!

00:17:23.510 --> 00:17:25.750
Come, Speed Warrior!

00:17:28.630 --> 00:17:32.870
Level 3 Junk Synchron tunes 
Level 2 Speed Warrior!

00:17:39.140 --> 00:17:42.680
The stars come together 
to call forth a new power!

00:17:42.680 --> 00:17:44.570
Become the path that lights the way!

00:17:44.980 --> 00:17:46.520
Synchro Summon!

00:17:46.520 --> 00:17:49.040
Come forth, Junk Warrior!

00:17:54.720 --> 00:17:58.560
This is a Riding Duel's Synchro Summon.

00:17:58.560 --> 00:18:01.850
Junk Warrior attacks Centaur Mina!

00:18:03.830 --> 00:18:05.500
Scrap Fist!

00:18:06.060 --> 00:18:07.990
I flip over my trap card!

00:18:07.990 --> 00:18:09.530
Fleur Guard!

00:18:09.530 --> 00:18:13.340
One monster on my field 
isn't destroyed in battle!

00:18:15.810 --> 00:18:18.060
But you still take battle damage!

00:18:20.630 --> 00:18:23.010
I set one card and end my turn.

00:18:24.750 --> 00:18:26.020
Incredible.

00:18:26.020 --> 00:18:29.200
They're both completely 
stopping each other's attacks.

00:18:29.200 --> 00:18:32.070
It's like they've battled 
each other many times before.

00:18:32.400 --> 00:18:34.720
Who is he?

00:18:35.860 --> 00:18:39.720
He acts completely different than the others.

00:18:40.110 --> 00:18:43.050
He's enjoying this duel.

00:18:44.520 --> 00:18:45.760
My turn!

00:18:47.540 --> 00:18:51.270
I summon the Tuner Monster Fleur Synchron!

00:18:53.270 --> 00:18:54.640
Tuner Monster…

00:18:54.850 --> 00:18:56.330
Yusei, it's coming!

00:18:56.330 --> 00:18:59.120
Yeah.  His ace monster.

00:18:59.120 --> 00:19:03.590
Level 2 Fleur Synchron 
tunes Level 6 Centaur Mina!

00:19:07.060 --> 00:19:09.640
The body born from the speed of light!

00:19:09.640 --> 00:19:13.200
It's time for the revolution!  
Bring me victory!

00:19:13.200 --> 00:19:14.870
Synchro Summon!

00:19:16.270 --> 00:19:19.200
Sparkle, Chevalier de Fleur!

00:19:20.400 --> 00:19:24.720
When Fleur Synchron is 
used to Synchro Summon,

00:19:24.720 --> 00:19:29.110
I can Special Summon one Level 
4-or-below monster in my hand!

00:19:29.110 --> 00:19:31.580
I summon Apprentice Knight!

00:19:34.750 --> 00:19:37.650
Scrap-Iron Scarecrow is set on my field.

00:19:37.650 --> 00:19:39.750
He must know that.

00:19:39.750 --> 00:19:42.790
I don't think he'll carelessly 
attack me, but…

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:46.530
I want to know what he's planning to do.

00:19:47.240 --> 00:19:49.770
Yusei is enjoying this?

00:19:50.140 --> 00:19:53.040
Chevalier de Fleur attacks Junk Warrior!

00:19:53.820 --> 00:19:55.350
I knew he'd come at me!

00:19:55.800 --> 00:19:58.680
Yusei, you shouldn't have provoked him!

00:19:58.680 --> 00:20:00.290
Fleur De Orage!

00:20:00.290 --> 00:20:02.390
I activate Scrap-Iron Scarecrow!

00:20:02.390 --> 00:20:04.660
It negates your monster's attack!

00:20:04.660 --> 00:20:06.450
That's what I was waiting for!

00:20:06.450 --> 00:20:09.000
I activate Chevalier de Fleur's effect!

00:20:09.000 --> 00:20:14.860
Once per turn, your spell or trap card's 
activation is negated and destroyed!

00:20:14.860 --> 00:20:16.150
I knew it!

00:20:27.220 --> 00:20:28.810
Well done.

00:20:28.810 --> 00:20:32.280
But I now know your ace monster's attributes!

00:20:34.520 --> 00:20:37.710
I flip over my trap card Miracle's Wake!

00:20:37.710 --> 00:20:43.060
I Special Summon a monster in my 
graveyard that was destroyed this turn!

00:20:43.060 --> 00:20:45.420
Resurrect, Junk Warrior!

00:20:51.800 --> 00:20:54.680
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:20:56.550 --> 00:20:58.870
Well done, Yusei Fudo.

00:21:06.340 --> 00:21:07.770
I knew it.

00:21:08.950 --> 00:21:10.710
Yusei!  Why?

00:21:14.680 --> 00:21:16.460
What about the explosion?

00:21:16.460 --> 00:21:17.650
It was a bluff.

00:21:17.650 --> 00:21:19.390
Who are you?

00:21:19.390 --> 00:21:21.390
Why are you doing horrible things?

00:21:26.860 --> 00:21:29.200
I'm Sherry LeBlanc.

00:21:29.200 --> 00:21:31.830
I was testing your abilities.

00:21:32.680 --> 00:21:35.150
A female D-Wheeler…

00:21:35.450 --> 00:21:37.270
I'm sorry that I tricked you.

00:21:37.270 --> 00:21:42.080
But I'm here to take you, Yusei Fudo.

00:21:42.080 --> 00:21:45.730
I won't let any other team have you!

00:22:09.460 --> 00:22:14.150
The small cliff floats on the Milky Way

00:22:14.160 --> 00:22:19.160
The sights I see are different 
than what I imagined

00:22:19.430 --> 00:22:24.070
Were you able to move on from the past?

00:22:24.070 --> 00:22:29.080
The answer isn't no, but 
there's something missing

00:22:29.270 --> 00:22:33.940
The cruel god tests us

00:22:34.240 --> 00:22:40.880
Let's fill the emptiness 
and head to the next stage

00:22:40.880 --> 00:22:44.750
If you ask me "What's our relationship?"

00:22:44.750 --> 00:22:50.620
We're more than friends... 
but that's not quite right

00:22:50.790 --> 00:22:54.530
Bond is the proper word

00:22:54.530 --> 00:23:00.500
As we fight, we understand each other

00:23:00.500 --> 00:23:03.470
"Where are you right now?"  "On Earth"

00:23:03.470 --> 00:23:05.710
Because I'm not an astronaut

00:23:05.710 --> 00:23:10.380
I have no problems when 
I'm below the ozone layer

00:23:10.680 --> 00:23:13.250
"I know, I'm coming right away."

00:23:13.250 --> 00:23:16.720
You want to party until the morning

00:23:16.720 --> 00:23:19.950
At our special place
